find out which sub-function is the bottleneck using:



Rprof("profilesim.out")

out<--sim(...)

summaryRprof("profilesim.out")



Unfortunately I get the following error:



summaryRprof("profilesim.out")

Error in FUN(X[[556L]], ...) : subscript out of bounds



