Carolina, I gather you have 20 observations ("n=20").  With this model, you
have many more parameters than that.   But even if i misread your note
about the n, odds are you're just asking too much from the data.  I'd start
with the simplest possible model, get that to work and then complicate it
one step at a time from there.  that way you'll be able to isolate what the
issue is.  maybe its one of the covariates is nearly constant or correlated
with another variable perhaps.

Gary
